---
description: Use graphify for architecture/dependency questions when graphify-out exists
alwaysApply: false
globs:
---

This project can use graphify for codebase knowledge graphs (`graphify-out/`).

Use graphify when the user asks about architecture, module relationships, or dependency paths:

```bash
graphify .                         # build graph (first time / major changes)
graphify path "<A>" "<B>"          # dependency path
graphify explain "<concept>"       # related nodes
graphify update .                  # refresh after code changes (AST-only)
```

Do not run graphify for routine single-file edits. Prefer Read/Grep for targeted work.

If `graphify-out/wiki/index.md` exists, prefer navigating that for broad orientation.
